{
    "type": "game",
    "name": "Neon Knights",
    "steam_appid": 3154390,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Drop into the wildest Brawler arena where you and your squad can flex those trigger fingers! Neon Knights is an action-packed, neon-drenched shooter that\u2019s all about local &amp; online multiplayer madness.\u00a0</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What\u2019s your Knight?\u00a0\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Arrow \u2013 Snipe \u2018em with precision!\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Machine \u2013 Spray and pray!\u00a0\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Blade \u2013 Use that cutting edge technology!\u00a0\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wall \u2013 Tank it like a boss!\u00a0\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Arcane \u2013 Make it rain! (with bullets, I mean)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face off against your friends or a horde of bots in dynamic Neon Arenas. Every time you burn out, you respawn harder, faster, stronger, brighter! Stack glorious powerups \u2018til you\u2019re a glowing juggernaut. Last Knight standing? That\u2019s the goal!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Solo queue? Squad up? Local couch co-op or online brawls? Neon Knights supports it all - play with your friends locally, play with some here and some there, play all online. We made this game as an homage to the best of days gone by - playing with your friends any way you\u2019d like.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It\u2019s time to light up that scoreboard, bury your rivals, and rule the Neon void tonight!!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Drop into the wildest Brawler arena where you and your squad can flex those trigger fingers! Neon Knights is an action-packed, neon-drenched shooter that\u2019s all about local &amp; online multiplayer madness.\u00a0</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What\u2019s your Knight?\u00a0\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Arrow \u2013 Snipe \u2018em with precision!\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Machine \u2013 Spray and pray!\u00a0\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Blade \u2013 Use that cutting edge technology!\u00a0\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wall \u2013 Tank it like a boss!\u00a0\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Arcane \u2013 Make it rain! (with bullets, I mean)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face off against your friends or a horde of bots in dynamic Neon Arenas. Every time you burn out, you respawn harder, faster, stronger, brighter! Stack glorious powerups \u2018til you\u2019re a glowing juggernaut. Last Knight standing? That\u2019s the goal!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Solo queue? Squad up? Local couch co-op or online brawls? Neon Knights supports it all - play with your friends locally, play with some here and some there, play all online. We made this game as an homage to the best of days gone by - playing with your friends any way you\u2019d like.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It\u2019s time to light up that scoreboard, bury your rivals, and rule the Neon void tonight!!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
